WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
We can save people, but what to do with this huge poison?

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:06,150
Don't go there!

3
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:07,550
Everybody stand up and seal it!

4
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:14,760
Dispersed?

5
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:16,890
Impossible!

6
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:19,830
Blood Spirituality!

7
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:24,680
How can a mountain runner wait for our treasure-holding people's tricks to break the bank account?

8
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:27,620
You people who are holding back treasure rely on the dead to find your way out.

9
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:30,850
I am a mountain runner and rely on mountains to make my living.

10
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:33,940
Little bastard, if you have the guts, come down!

11
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:38,130
If he wants to run away from somewhere else, I will lead people to block the south entrance! No need

12
00:00:38,130 --> 00:00:39,130
No need?
